    "No measured Y6 curves, data vector, covariance, area or shape-noise values are fabricated.",
    "source.path must point to a supplied FITS nz_source table before prepare can run.",
    "The five chosen apertures 3,5,10,20,40 arcmin give 100 Map3 entries for four source bins.",
    "The 20 xi bins from 2.5 to 250 arcmin are a forecast design choice, not an asserted released Y6 binning.",
    "The illustrative cosmological baseline is inherited from the Y3 example, not a Y6 best fit.",
    "core_tatt requests the unchanged ordinary CosmoLike CFASTPT E/B model for all xi rows.",
    "Source calibration priors and survey-specific numerical convergence remain to be supplied or established.",
    "The analytic covariance includes gravitational connected terms only and selected halo response, not nonlinear-IA covariance or full SSC.",
    "Signed ratios and the stretched shape chart avoid the documented raw-residual interpolation failure. The stretch is half ln(2 ell_max/ell_min); these starting grids still require estimator-specific refinement."
